   "bundle": "org/netbeans/modules/uihandler/Bundle.properties",
   "key": "MSG_SCAN_CANCELLED_EARLY",
   "en": "<html>It is not possible to interrupt the scanning process.<br>\\ If you are encountering a problem related to scanning and would like to report it,<br>\\ please wait for <b>several minutes</b> so statistics are gathered, then the report <br>\\ will be generated and you will be prompted with an option to send the report."
  },
